  "source_principle": "The human remains the constitutional source. Digital faculties extend human attention and execution capacity without silently transferring sovereignty.",
  "economic_goal": "Allow autonomous applications and websites to perform continuous business operations so humans can redirect time and energy toward family, community, creative judgment and physical life.",
